Error [E2424]: Function `bare` promises `Never` but uses a bare `return`.
  --> tests/ui/never_return_bare.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     return
    |     ^^^^^^
 Why: A declared `Never` return cannot complete with an empty return; every path must diverge (D-NEVER2=B).
 Fix: Remove the bare `return`, or make this function return a value type.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2424
